{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow paced tactical tank sim with bursts of action. You can choose to be methodical, pausing to plan out every move, or advance violently and adapt on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/b83ad2aa2d8309a0c89736eb90be1838.avif?t=1761362263\" width=1402 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still <strong>early</strong> in development, and I plan to release the game once it's complete. Please follow or wishlist if you want to be be notified when the game is out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/a0c3f057cae2b41a4a08be6b47089600.poster.avif?t=1761362263\" width=480 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/a0c3f057cae2b41a4a08be6b47089600.webm?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/a0c3f057cae2b41a4a08be6b47089600.mp4?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Maneuver through desert streets, assessing choke points and watching for ambushes in the alleys. Use powerful ordnance to eliminate clustered forces or collapse buildings to form new routes. Smoke to stage a push or obscure a retreat. Fight intelligent enemies which play by the same rules, lying in wait, organizing flanking attacks, or regrouping when threatened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1e82cb19b7925adf7be383a54e79b5a3.poster.avif?t=1761362263\" width=480 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1e82cb19b7925adf7be383a54e79b5a3.webm?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1e82cb19b7925adf7be383a54e79b5a3.mp4?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have time, even in the most chaotic battles, to take a step back and plan your next moves. Draw out precise paths with waypoints to ensure all angles are covered. Use complete control over the movement of your vehicles and infantry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/0b85a58d317946a2c8d2fc79fe562ab3.poster.avif?t=1761362263\" width=480 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/0b85a58d317946a2c8d2fc79fe562ab3.webm?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/0b85a58d317946a2c8d2fc79fe562ab3.mp4?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your tanks with a modular loadout system! Bring a phalanx of superheavy tanks plastered with ERA, or ambush enemy armor with infantry in buildings, backed up by their IFVs equipped with dangerous ATGMs. Mix and match modules for necessity or for doctrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMPLEXITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual crew stats, module health, and precise armor penetration values, are all parts of the simulation, with the goal of incorporating realism while keeping it fun. ERA specializes against tandem warheads, crew will (poorly) cover for dead crew in other roles, and fires are put out faster when the vehicle is out of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPAIGN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve a path through the sand and streets of abandoned districts towards the forgotten edge of the city. Stalk through the territories of powerful factions, or hunt their elite forces down yourself. Manage your convoy, crew, and resources within your mercenary company.\u00a0Make honorable choices, or let desperation or greed dictate your policy.\u00a0Find notable characters with an array of roles, experience, and skills to join your company.  Fight rival mercenaries and take lucrative contracts as the city stirs from its sleep.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/ba28f7e69eff5862270da5c7ac9aad63.avif?t=1761362263\" width=146 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow me on twitter (@aeoridev or the link in the sidebar) to catch the latest cool stuff I'm working on!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also publish playable alpha builds on itch, those have some missions where you can playtest game mechanics. I always appreciate feedback!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1c1bfa5c71b1aeab416ebf1028867626.avif?t=1761362263\" width=849 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001820?t=1761362263","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/74ae326ea5e87959a581afeb5fd6549d2cbf233b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761362263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/23babd7da135ac7fed530abe796c4d87ce8b7f2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761362263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/23babd7da135ac7fed530abe796c4d87ce8b7f2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761362263","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"there are tanks and explosions and dying and stuff"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A slow paced tactical tank sim with bursts of action. You can choose to be methodical, pausing to plan out every move, or advance violently and adapt on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/b83ad2aa2d8309a0c89736eb90be1838.avif?t=1761362263\" width=1402 height=460 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still <strong>early</strong> in development, and I plan to release the game once it's complete. Please follow or wishlist if you want to be be notified when the game is out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/a0c3f057cae2b41a4a08be6b47089600.poster.avif?t=1761362263\" width=480 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/a0c3f057cae2b41a4a08be6b47089600.webm?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/a0c3f057cae2b41a4a08be6b47089600.mp4?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Maneuver through desert streets, assessing choke points and watching for ambushes in the alleys. Use powerful ordnance to eliminate clustered forces or collapse buildings to form new routes. Smoke to stage a push or obscure a retreat. Fight intelligent enemies which play by the same rules, lying in wait, organizing flanking attacks, or regrouping when threatened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1e82cb19b7925adf7be383a54e79b5a3.poster.avif?t=1761362263\" width=480 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1e82cb19b7925adf7be383a54e79b5a3.webm?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1e82cb19b7925adf7be383a54e79b5a3.mp4?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have time, even in the most chaotic battles, to take a step back and plan your next moves. Draw out precise paths with waypoints to ensure all angles are covered. Use complete control over the movement of your vehicles and infantry.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/0b85a58d317946a2c8d2fc79fe562ab3.poster.avif?t=1761362263\" width=480 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/0b85a58d317946a2c8d2fc79fe562ab3.webm?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/0b85a58d317946a2c8d2fc79fe562ab3.mp4?t=1761362263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your tanks with a modular loadout system! Bring a phalanx of superheavy tanks plastered with ERA, or ambush enemy armor with infantry in buildings, backed up by their IFVs equipped with dangerous ATGMs. Mix and match modules for necessity or for doctrine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMPLEXITY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual crew stats, module health, and precise armor penetration values, are all parts of the simulation, with the goal of incorporating realism while keeping it fun. ERA specializes against tandem warheads, crew will (poorly) cover for dead crew in other roles, and fires are put out faster when the vehicle is out of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CAMPAIGN</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve a path through the sand and streets of abandoned districts towards the forgotten edge of the city. Stalk through the territories of powerful factions, or hunt their elite forces down yourself. Manage your convoy, crew, and resources within your mercenary company.\u00a0Make honorable choices, or let desperation or greed dictate your policy.\u00a0Find notable characters with an array of roles, experience, and skills to join your company.  Fight rival mercenaries and take lucrative contracts as the city stirs from its sleep.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/ba28f7e69eff5862270da5c7ac9aad63.avif?t=1761362263\" width=146 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow me on twitter (@aeoridev or the link in the sidebar) to catch the latest cool stuff I'm working on!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I also publish playable alpha builds on itch, those have some missions where you can playtest game mechanics. I always appreciate feedback!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/extras/1c1bfa5c71b1aeab416ebf1028867626.avif?t=1761362263\" width=849 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["aeoridev"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/ee6a1f192f7e7274b13431a4a7eba79379cac626/header.jpg?t=1761362263","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Armaphract","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 780<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["aeoridev"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nDrogen","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q4 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/1a1aa94e832bbbb75acac834813b59eedf3225e1/ss_1a1aa94e832bbbb75acac834813b59eedf3225e1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761362263","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/1a1aa94e832bbbb75acac834813b59eedf3225e1/ss_1a1aa94e832bbbb75acac834813b59eedf3225e1.600x338.jpg?t=1761362263"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/a9e5347a92e0de20215bf1e37dcf929f23cdf6c5/ss_a9e5347a92e0de20215bf1e37dcf929f23cdf6c5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761362263","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/a9e5347a92e0de20215bf1e37dcf929f23cdf6c5/ss_a9e5347a92e0de20215bf1e37dcf929f23cdf6c5.600x338.jpg?t=1761362263"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared