90a5cd2.600x338.jpg?t=1761362263"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/4aa30fdf2cec34e25638177dbcdba227b9d08ef4/ss_4aa30fdf2cec34e25638177dbcdba227b9d08ef4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761362263","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/4aa30fdf2cec34e25638177dbcdba227b9d08ef4/ss_4aa30fdf2cec34e25638177dbcdba227b9d08ef4.600x338.jpg?t=1761362263"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/6c7e7bd4fd2275fc49c7b6c0cc6dab3faaf28cc9/ss_6c7e7bd4fd2275fc49c7b6c0cc6dab3faaf28cc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761362263","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/6c7e7bd4fd2275fc49c7b6c0cc6dab3faaf28cc9/ss_6c7e7bd4fd2275fc49c7b6c0cc6dab3faaf28cc9.600x338.jpg?t=1761362263"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/cbb5f11e7216e4e3232d8b5aacd4b4ca7dbb07b7/ss_cbb5f11e7216e4e3232d8b5aacd4b4ca7dbb07b7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761362263","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001820/cbb5f11e7216e4e3232d8b5aacd4b4ca7dbb07b7/ss_cbb5f11e7216e4e3232d8b5aacd4b4ca7dbb07b7.600x338.jpg?t=1761362263"}],"short_description":"Command a mercenary tank company in deadly urban warfare through a shattered desert megacity. Outmatched and outgunned, you'll survive through superior tactics and cunning maneuvers against intelligent enemy forces.","steam_appid":4001820,"support_info":{"email":"aeoridev@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://aeoriii.itch.io/ironmirage"}